#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:14
#: c6eb8478b9d24f57b756bd38c48caccd
msgid "Setting the Home Position"
msgstr "设置 Home 位置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:16
#: 900b62b727db41dabb617f8fe41c2489
msgid ""
"For **Copter**, **Plane** and **Rover** the home position is set as the "
"location where the vehicle was armed. This means if you execute an RTL, "
"it will return to the location where it was armed, so arm your vehicle in"
" the location you want it to return to, or use a rally point to setup an "
"alternative return point."
msgstr ""
"对于 **Copter**、**Plane** 和 **Rover**，Home 位置设置为飞行器解锁时的位置。这意味着如果执行 "
"RTL，它将返回到解锁时的位置，因此请在您希望飞行器返回的位置解锁，或使用集结点设置备用返回点。"

