msgid "Instructions"
msgstr "说明"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:36
#: b634d656f20c401489ebaa9c2e1410c7
msgid ""
"In the screenshot below, a Copter mission starts with an auto takeoff to "
"20 meters altitude; then goes to WP 2 rising to 100 meters altitude on "
"the way, then waits 10 seconds; then the craft will proceed to WP 3 "
"(descending to 50 meters altitude on the way), then returns to launch. "
"After reaching the launch position, the craft will land. The mission "
"assumes that the launch position is set at the home position."
msgstr ""
"在下方截图中，一个 Copter 任务从自动起飞到 20 米高度开始；然后前往航点 2，途中爬升到 100 米高度，然后等待 10 "
"秒；之后飞行器将前往航点 3（途中下降到 50 米高度），然后返回起飞点。到达起飞位置后，飞行器将降落。任务假设起飞位置设置在 Home 位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:47
#: 5ddb8795c56e4d8087cf2f110735884e
msgid "Copter: Mission Planning Example"
msgstr "Copter：任务规划示例"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:49
#: 4c082662459042f0a073e7cb040a1e80
msgid ""
"You can enter waypoints and other commands (see the :ref:`Mission "
"commands <common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-"
"events_mission_commands>` section below for more information). In the "
"dropdown menus on each row, select the command you want. The column "
"heading will change to show you what data that command requires. Lat and "
"Lon can be entered by clicking on the map. Altitude is relative to your "
"launch altitude/home position, so if you set 100m, for example, it will "
"fly 100m above you."
msgstr ""
"您可以输入航点和其他命令（详见下面的 :ref:`任务命令 <common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-"
"and-events_mission_commands>` "
"部分）。在每行的下拉菜单中，选择您想要的命令。列标题将变化以显示该命令所需的数据。纬度和经度可通过点击地图输入。高度相对于起飞高度/Home "
"位置，因此如果您设置 100m，例如，它将在您上方 100m 处飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:58
#: 4daba3b95b554a5cbd6068dc0b5d95bf
msgid ""
"**Default Alt** is the default altitude when entering new waypoints. See "
":ref:`common-understanding-altitude` for altitude definitions."
msgstr "**Default Alt** 是输入新航点时的默认高度。高度定义请参阅 :ref:`common-understanding-altitude`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:60
#: f57d512ace374f5dbd0c1ace5b8e567e
msgid ""
"**Verify height** means that the Mission Planner will use Google Earth "
"topology data to adjust your desired altitude at each waypoint to reflect"
" the height of the ground beneath. So if your waypoint is on a hill, if "
"this option is selected the *Mission Planner* will increase your ALT "
"setting by the height of the hill. This is a good way to make sure you "
"don't crash into mountains!"
msgstr ""
"**Verify height** 意味着 Mission Planner 将使用 Google Earth "
"地形数据调整每个航点的期望高度以反映下方地面的高度。因此，如果您的航点在山丘上，如果选择了此选项，*Mission Planner* "
"将按照山丘的高度增加您的 ALT 设置。这是确保不会撞山的好方法！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:67
#: 2e5ef0281f8e4e549c071f47ccc372e3
msgid ""
"Once you are done with your mission, select **Write** and it will be sent"
" to APM and saved in EEPROM. You can confirm that it's as you wanted by "
"selecting **Read**."
msgstr "完成任务后，选择 **Write**，它将被发送到 APM 并保存在 EEPROM 中。您可以通过选择 **Read** 确认是否符合您的需求。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:71
#: 8a886cf3c32b4263b2f57e7319e7fa2a
msgid ""
"You can save multiple mission files to your local hard drive by selecting"
" **Save WP File** or read in files with **Load WP File** in the right-"
"click menu:"
msgstr "您可以通过选择 **Save WP File** 将多个任务文件保存到本地硬盘，或通过右键菜单中的 **Load WP File** 读取文件："

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:79
#: b107241ac1d44f7ba827c71af5159391
msgid "Tips"
msgstr "提示"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:81
#: baa1ed30c9a1485886dfabf8f7c44ba8
msgid ""
"Prefetch: You can cache map data so you don't need Internet access at the"
" field. Click the **Prefetch** button, and hold down **Alt** to draw a "
"box to download the selected imagery of a location."
msgstr "预取：您可以缓存地图数据，这样在野外不需要互联网访问。点击 **Prefetch** 按钮，按住 **Alt** 键绘制一个框来下载所选位置的图像。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:84
#: 66fa4c7428834e0a9eb1e1b9611d034e
msgid ""
"Grid: This allows you to draw a polygon (right click) and automatically "
"create waypoints over the selected area. Note that it does not do "
"\"island detection\", which means if you have a big polygon and a little "
"one inside of that, the little one will not be excluded from the big one "
"(see `this <http://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Relation:multipolygon>`__ "
"for more). Also, in the case of any polygon that partialy doubles backs "
"on itself (like the letter U), the open area in the center will be "
"included as part of the flyover."
msgstr ""
"网格：这允许您绘制多边形（右键点击）并在所选区域上自动创建航点。请注意，它不执行「岛屿检测」，这意味着如果您有一个大多边形和其中的小多边形，小多边形不会从大多边形中排除（更多信息请参阅"
" `此处 "
"<http://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Relation:multipolygon>`__）。此外，对于任何部分向后折叠的多边形（如字母"
" U），中间的开放区域将作为飞越区域的一部分包含在内。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:93
#: 57efb8c95c8f4ef6a7521c3a1472b8f8
msgid ""
"Setting your home location to the current location is easy, just click "
"**Home Location** above where you enter your home location, and it will "
"set your home location to the current coordinates."
msgstr ""
"将 Home 位置设置为当前位置很简单，只需点击输入 Home 位置上方的 **Home Location**，它将把 Home "
"位置设置为当前坐标。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:96
#: d9106bcbae4b4184bcddf32aacdfe462
msgid ""
"You can measure the distance between waypoints by right-clicking at one "
"end and selecting Measure Distance. Then right-click on the other end and"
" select **Measure Distance** again. A dialog box will open with the "
"distance between the two points."
msgstr ""
"您可以通过在一端右键点击选择 Measure Distance 来测量航点之间的距离。然后在另一端右键点击再次选择 **Measure "
"Distance**。对话框将打开并显示两点之间的距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:102
#: bee166a25d3f4d11a33b3ad9873ecd4d
msgid "Auto grid"
msgstr "自动网格"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:104
#: f0f9e244947e4348bdb299d43618327a
msgid ""
"You can also have the *Mission Planner* create a mission for you, which "
"is useful for function like mapping missions, where the aircraft should "
"just go back and forth in a \"lawnmower\" pattern over an area to collect"
" photographs."
msgstr "您还可以让 *Mission Planner* 为您创建任务，这对于测绘任务等功能很有用，飞行器只需在某个区域以「割草机」模式来回飞行收集照片。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:109
#: 048c1f65dbbd4b568cbb623a2c6bcc39
msgid ""
"To do this, in the right-click menu select Polygon and draw a box around "
"the area you want to map. Then select Auto WP, Grid. Follow the dialog "
"box process to select altitude and spacing. The *Mission Planner* will "
"then generate a mission that looks something like this:"
msgstr ""
"为此，在右键菜单中选择 Polygon 并在要测绘的区域画一个框。然后选择 Auto "
"WP，Grid。按照对话框流程选择高度和间距。*Mission Planner* 将生成一个类似如下的任务："

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:117
#: 9f39651fa6754108ae546e4e38d9865a
msgid "Mission Planner auto-generated grid"
msgstr "Mission Planner 自动生成的网格"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:123
#: e310f5a23c914bbe9a24354121c73f64
msgid "Mission commands"
msgstr "任务命令"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:125
#: 834e27b81f544cf09125b9041df9b93e
msgid ""
"*Mission Planner* provides a filtered list of the commands appropriate "
"for the current vehicle type, and adds column headings for the parameters"
" that need user-supplied values. These include navigation commands to "
"travel to waypoints and loiter in the vicinity, DO commands to execute "
"specific actions (for example taking pictures), and condition commands "
"that can control when DO commands are able to run."
msgstr ""
"*Mission Planner* "
"提供适合当前飞行器类型的命令过滤列表，并为需要用户提供值的参数添加列标题。这些包括前往航点和在附近盘旋的导航命令、执行特定动作（如拍照）的 DO "
"命令，以及可以控制 DO 命令何时运行的条件命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:135
#: ca1e58d65d5d44afb7b52c88271c2d17
msgid ""
"Example: LOITER_TURNS command withheadings for number of turns, "
"direction, and location to loiteraround."
msgstr "示例：LOITER_TURNS 命令，带有圈数、方向和盘旋位置的列标题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:137
#: 3bb0451aea414a58bbc24f8b4b354740
msgid ""
"The full set of mission commands supported by all ArduPilot platforms are"
" listed in :ref:`MAVLink Mission Command Messages (MAV_CMD) <common-"
"mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd>`. This includes the full name "
"of each command (as defined in the protocol definition), information "
"about which parameters are supported, and also the corresponding *Mission"
" Planner* column headings."
msgstr ""
"所有 ArduPilot 平台支持的完整任务命令集列于 :ref:`MAVLink 任务命令消息（MAV_CMD） <common-"
"mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd>` "
"中。这包括每个命令的完整名称（如协议定义中所定义）、支持哪些参数的信息，以及对应的 *Mission Planner* 列标题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:145
#: 4cad4210bd664e87bfaa8b6bd3bd9697
msgid ""
"Mission Planner uses a cut-down version of the full command name. For "
"example, commands like MAV_CMD_NAV_WAYPOINT, MAV_CMD_CONDITION_DISTANCE, "
"MAV_CMD_DO_SET_SERVO are listed in MP as WAYPOINT, CONDITION_DISTANCE and"
" DO_SET_SERVO respectively."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner "
"使用完整指令名称的简化版本。例如，MAV_CMD_NAV_WAYPOINT、MAV_CMD_CONDITION_DISTANCE、MAV_CMD_DO_SET_SERVO"
" 等指令在 Mission Planner 中分别显示为 WAYPOINT、CONDITION_DISTANCE 和 DO_SET_SERVO。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:153
#: 244646d9a75c408c89d23c429ee15e45
msgid "End of Mission"
msgstr "任务结束"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:155
#: 271c90e39a334e2c837bc63399217368
msgid ""
"When the mission list is completed, Copter will loiter at the last "
"waypoint indefinitely until a mode change or disarm (as when landing), "
"Rover will hold, but Plane will RTL unless the last mission item is "
"unlimited loiter or turns, or a landing."
msgstr ""
"当任务列表执行完毕后，Copter 将在最后一个航点无限期悬停，直到模式切换或上锁（如降落时）；Rover 将保持停止；但 Plane 将执行 "
"RTL，除非最后一个任务项是无限期盘旋、转弯或降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:158
#: 58d7cb351be749dca1846942b7f79333
msgid "Mission Reset"
msgstr "任务重置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:160
#: 87f4863cc97a488db4a313d2517f18c0
msgid ""
"On Copter and Rover, the mission is reset to the beginning of the mission"
" list every disarm. On Plane, it is reset similarly, except in AUTO mode "
"which does not reset on disarm and leaves the \"mission pointer\" on the "
"last mission item to be performed. For all vehicles, any landing mission "
"item, when the landing is completed, will not advance to the next mission"
" item. The :ref:`MIS_OPTIONS<MIS_OPTIONS>` parameter, bit 2, can be set "
"to continue onward in the mission list after landing."
msgstr ""
"在 Copter 和 Rover 上，每次上锁时任务都会重置到任务列表的开头。在 Plane 上，除 AUTO 模式外同样会重置，AUTO "
"模式不会在上锁时重置，而是将「任务指针」停留在最后执行的任务项上。对所有机型，任何降落任务项完成降落后，都不会自动跳到下一个任务项。:ref:`MIS_OPTIONS<MIS_OPTIONS>`"
" 参数的第 2 位可设置为在降落后继续执行任务列表。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:162
#: d99f532ea4464c5c862ef4623ae4f589
msgid ""
"One can set an ``RCx_OPTION`` switch function (\"24\") to reset the "
"mission item pointer to the beginning of the mission list at any time."
msgstr "可以设置 ``RCx_OPTION`` 开关功能（「24」）以在任何时候将任务项指针重置到任务列表的开头。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:164
#: 4aac5446ad444e2f9e828804c9566faa
msgid ""
"Also, the mission can be set to reset upon any entry into AUTO mode with "
"the :ref:`MIS_RESTART<MIS_RESTART>` parameter. Default (0) is to resume "
"the mission when re-entering AUTO mode."
msgstr ""
"此外，也可通过 :ref:`MIS_RESTART<MIS_RESTART>` 参数将任务设置为在每次进入 AUTO "
"模式时重置。默认值（0）为重新进入 AUTO 模式时恢复任务。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:167
#: 4367177a315d469fa19f94b8f11da629
