#: 75a991baa83841d4b871a34afdb5a9d9
msgid ""
"The behavior of returning to a mission sequence when interrupted by a "
"mode change is described in the :ref:`common-mission-rewind` section."
msgstr "模式切换中断任务后返回任务序列的行为，在 :ref:`common-mission-rewind` 部分中有详细说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:185
