#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:187
#: 0b24382628294a79b5f3c2e184b636ae
msgid ""
"The number of mission items which can be stored in the autopilot is "
"limited to approximately 650 waypoints. If you need to have longer "
"missions, then you can set the :ref:`BRD_SD_MISSION<BRD_SD_MISSION>` "
"parameter to create a file on the SD Card to store more. This can be set "
"up to a maximum of 64 (kB) which would allow a total of over 4,000 "
"waypoints in a mission."
msgstr ""
"飞控中可存储的任务项数量限制约为 650 个航点。如需更长的任务，可将 :ref:`BRD_SD_MISSION<BRD_SD_MISSION>`"
" 参数设置为在 SD 卡上创建文件以存储更多航点。最大可设置为 64（kB），从而支持任务中超过 4000 个航点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:190
#: 3381a148a3d042ae9575bdf1b1952b13
msgid "How to prefetch a stored Mission Map"
